			<u>Ion</u>
			130
		</span></i> (lyr.); 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαντ-ήϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>:—poet. for
